scylla_memory_system_dirty_bytes{shard="0"} 2490368.000000
scylla_memory_system_dirty_bytes{shard="1"} 131072.000000
scylla_memory_system_dirty_bytes{shard="2"} 131072.000000
scylla_memory_system_dirty_bytes{shard="3"} 131072.000000
# HELP scylla_memory_system_unspooled_dirty_bytes Holds the size of used memory in bytes. Compare it to "dirty_bytes" to see how many memory is wasted (neither used nor available).
